#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:6
msgid "PM Power Management Sample"
msgstr "PM 电源管理示例"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:10
msgid ""
"The `pm_demo` sample demonstrates the usage of the Power Management (PM) "
"subsystem. It shows how to enter low-power modes, configure GPIO wake-up,"
" and preserve application state across low-power transitions."
msgstr "`pm_demo` 示例演示了电源管理（PM）子系统的使用方法。它展示了如何进入低功耗模式、配置 GPIO 唤醒以及在低功耗转换过程中保持应用程序状态。"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:12
msgid "Features Demonstrated"
msgstr "功能演示"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:14
msgid "Entering Deep/Suspend sleep using `tlk_api_sleep`"
msgstr "使用 `tlk_api_sleep` 进入深度睡眠/挂起睡眠"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:15
msgid "GPIO wake-up configuration (optional)"
msgstr "GPIO 唤醒配置（可选）"

