msgstr "**LED 状态初始化** — 当启用 `CONFIG_TLK_PM_DEMO_ENABLE_LED` 时："

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:24
msgid "LED state variables are stored in the **retention section**"
msgstr "LED 状态变量存储在**保持区域**中"

#: ../../source/samples/pm.md:25
